# 3. Data Types

Python automatically detects the data type of a variable.

```python
name = "Python"
age = 22
salary = 45000.50
is_employee = True

print(type(name))
print(type(age))
print(type(salary))
print(type(is_employee))
```

### Output

```
<class 'str'>
<class 'int'>
<class 'float'>
<class 'bool'>
```

