# 5. Type Casting

```python
age = int(input("Enter your age: "))

print(age + 5)
```

```python
salary = float(input("Enter your salary: "))

print(salary * 12)
```

---

# 6. Multiple Assignment

```python
x, y, z = 10, 20, 30

print(x)
print(y)
print(z)
```

---

# 7. Swapping Variables

```python
a = 10
b = 20

a, b = b, a

print(a)
print(b)
```

